From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:47:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: describe the HDMI port on
 dcpext0

Describe the J604's HDMI port from its ADT, in the form of the M3 Pro
MacBook Pro HDMI port (t603x-j514s-j516s-hdmi.dtsi): a fixed DisplayPort
output of the hybrid external display coprocessor through an ATC PHY and
its display crossbar into an on-board DP-to-HDMI converter.

J604 values (ADT port-hdmi-1, atc2-dpphy, atc2-dpxbar, dp2hdmi-gpio0,
i2c0/pcon0, display-crossbar0):
- ATC2 as the DP PHY (atc2-dpphy: port-type HDMI, transport not
  tunnelled, dp-switch-dfp-endpoint 2, dp-switch-dfp-port 0);
- the ATC2 crossbar, with dcpext0's UFP selector 2 (the selector it uses
  on every ATC crossbar);
- HPD on AOP GPIO 41, the converter power on SMC gP1a (26) and the port
  power on SMC gP0f (15), the same SMC keys as the M3 Pro;
- the converter itself at i2c0 0x08, served through its DPTX link like on
  the M3 Pro, so no i2c node.

The port is put on dcpext0 next to its Type-C routes, as on the M3 Pro;
the ADT does not tie it to one dispext.

Nothing changes at runtime: dcpext0, ATC2, its crossbar and ATC2's power
domains all stay disabled. No driver in this tree drives a T8132 external
coprocessor yet, and the T8132 ATC PHY has no DisplayPort mode outside
USB4 tunnels; the DPA1 audio node needs a T8132 SIO node first.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
[j604-int: 1.609 integration onto a15y 0f06dbf809 after j604/k609-deep-sleep: t8132-j604.dts end-of-file
 conflict, both sides append one #include after t8132-j604-dcpext.dtsi. Kept both, deep-sleep's t8132-j604-sleep.dtsi first,
 then this t8132-j604-hdmi.dtsi. No other hunk touched.]

---
 .../boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-dcpext.dtsi     |  4 +-
 .../arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-hdmi.dtsi | 92 +++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts      |  2 +
 3 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-hdmi.dtsi

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-dcpext.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-dcpext.dtsi
index d4d14b4e1d..7a71cd7bf4 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-dcpext.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604-dcpext.dtsi
@@ -24,8 +24,8 @@
  * disabled too until the external display driver is enabled with them.
  *
  * The J604's HDMI port (port-hdmi-1: ATC2's DisplayPort-only PHY, its
- * display crossbar and an on-board DP-to-HDMI converter) is not described
- * here: the T8132 external display path drives DisplayPort tunnels only.
